  "title": "Inside Pacific Stone: Decade of California Cannabis from a Family-Owned Carpinteria Greenhouse",
  "summary": "In a California cannabis market defined by premium positioning and lifestyle branding, Pacific Stone took a different path. The family-owned greenhouse brand — founded in 2015 and based in Carpinteria, California — built its reputation on quality, consistency, and accessible pricing. Today, Pacific Stone is one of the most consistently recommended affordable cannabis brands in California, with a catalog spanning pre-roll tins, hemp-wrapped blunts, and large-format flower that has made it a first recommendation at dispensaries across the state.",
